  "why": "Envelope of the two identifications of this arm design (ours and NVIDIA AnchorBench) widened by 20 % (OmniReset uses x0.8-1.2). Wider than x0.8-1.2 around our fit because some values differ a lot between fits and do not all transfer to other arms (verification: our wrist_roll friction is 2.5x NVIDIA and worse on 4/6 public teleop arms). Delay 0-30 ms: the fit put delay at its 0 ms bound; real step onset is 24 ms vs 12 ms in the fitted sim, so latency is partly absorbed into slower dynamics."
